    "name": "Animal Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 2987320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/0f2be67c61e3c8a628cda5b375e0e16e.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/0f2be67c61e3c8a628cda5b375e0e16e.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/0f2be67c61e3c8a628cda5b375e0e16e.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/aaeebb116f1a9f6c4749eec7686b0226.avif?t=1742169612\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Animal Adventure] is a platformer party game where you combine various animal characters and spirits to jump over obstacles. You can enjoy the game with your friends or alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose a cute animal character and use your skills to disrupt your opponents!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has a different skill. Lead your team to victory by blowing away or disrupting opponents who come near you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/538148dae843d08db7adc18aeb3c54c0.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/538148dae843d08db7adc18aeb3c54c0.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/538148dae843d08db7adc18aeb3c54c0.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose two spirits of your choice for your animal characters and play with strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spirit has a different skill that can be used for each spirit, just like the character. Create your own skill set and use it in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/ab4ae0c989bcd0d3cbfd7c1bf6b62b7c.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/ab4ae0c989bcd0d3cbfd7c1bf6b62b7c.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/ab4ae0c989bcd0d3cbfd7c1bf6b62b7c.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The key may be to make good use of each character's ultimate skill!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character's unique ultimate skill makes a big difference as a strategic element in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience successful play by reading and predicting your opponent's strategy when using the ultimate skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/bc04a8de5bfc70a723bddd354b611296.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/bc04a8de5bfc70a723bddd354b611296.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/bc04a8de5bfc70a723bddd354b611296.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy easy play with easy controls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple. Move with the W, A, S, D keys and jump with the space key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >General skills are used with the left and right mouse buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the ultimate skill that can change the game's course can be used with the Left-Shift key.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/0f2be67c61e3c8a628cda5b375e0e16e.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/0f2be67c61e3c8a628cda5b375e0e16e.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/0f2be67c61e3c8a628cda5b375e0e16e.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/aaeebb116f1a9f6c4749eec7686b0226.avif?t=1742169612\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Animal Adventure] is a platformer party game where you combine various animal characters and spirits to jump over obstacles. You can enjoy the game with your friends or alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose a cute animal character and use your skills to disrupt your opponents!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has a different skill. Lead your team to victory by blowing away or disrupting opponents who come near you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/538148dae843d08db7adc18aeb3c54c0.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/538148dae843d08db7adc18aeb3c54c0.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/538148dae843d08db7adc18aeb3c54c0.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose two spirits of your choice for your animal characters and play with strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spirit has a different skill that can be used for each spirit, just like the character. Create your own skill set and use it in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/ab4ae0c989bcd0d3cbfd7c1bf6b62b7c.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/ab4ae0c989bcd0d3cbfd7c1bf6b62b7c.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/ab4ae0c989bcd0d3cbfd7c1bf6b62b7c.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The key may be to make good use of each character's ultimate skill!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character's unique ultimate skill makes a big difference as a strategic element in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience successful play by reading and predicting your opponent's strategy when using the ultimate skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/bc04a8de5bfc70a723bddd354b611296.poster.avif?t=1742169612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/bc04a8de5bfc70a723bddd354b611296.webm?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987320/extras/bc04a8de5bfc70a723bddd354b611296.mp4?t=1742169612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy easy play with easy controls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple. Move with the W, A, S, D keys and jump with the space key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >General skills are used with the left and right mouse buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the ultimate skill that can change the game's course can be used with the Left-Shift key.</p>",
